        "ñ": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "Maeve Collins", "kicker": "Air garden", "angle": 2.2, "color": "#3a6a4a", "skin": "#f0d4b8", "hair": "#c8603a", "text": "Maeve tended the fronds with Ezra. She didn’t go to the shelter. A note in her hand: “Ezra — I’m not going in there. The air in B smells like upstairs. Come and find me.”\n\nHe didn’t. She stayed, and the robots found her instead."}},
