        "ú": {"item": "ds-micro-display", "props": {"face": "s", "w": 2, "title": "Microscope feed · live", "kicker": "Oncology lab", "text": "THERAPEUTIC SYNTHIDS VS. CARCINOMA · LIVE\n\nA red cell, swollen and wrong. Teal specks arrive, one by one, and settle on it, and it gets smaller, and smaller, and then there is nothing left of it but the teal.\n\nThey know the difference."}},
